# The build context for sites/playground/Dockerfile is the repository root, so this is the one
# ignore file the image build reads. Build outputs and installed dependencies: the image builds its
# own, and these are large. The vendored DrawnUI demo pages under sites/playground/reference are
# read only by the sync script, never by a build.
.git
target
**/target
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
artifacts
bin
obj
docs
src/vscode/*.vsix
sites/playground/reference
